// #483/#491 - Standcast was a bare, unimplemented stub (unimplementedAbilities.scp). NOT "cast
// without interruption" (a misleading surface reading of the name) - the real Erebor mechanic is
// a toggle: the caster's next successful Magery cast gets Erebor's level bonus against monsters
// (StandcastHelper.CalculateLevelBonus, level alone, not ability points), at the cost of being
// unable to move during that cast. Mage/Necromancer/Shaman only (via the profession defs'
// ability listing). Blocked while Energy Shield is active (StandcastAbilityDef.On_DenyActivate).
[StandcastAbilityDef a_standcast]
Name="Standcast"

PluginKey = @@standcast
PluginDef = p_standcast

[StandcastPluginDef p_standcast]

[function standcast]
a_standcast.Activate(this)

[function cancelstandcast]
a_standcast.Deactivate(this)
